  "description": "Tomer took one of the most successful apps in the world and built it for his local market. Today, just 12 months after launching, he's already doing over $80K/month. \n\nThis video breaks down his playbook for reverse-engineering a proven app idea and building your own. \n*iOS App Ideas:* http://go.starterstory.com/lp-test-3-ios-app-ideas-description \n\nFollow Tomer: https://twitter.com/tomercn\nCheck Cal Buddy: https://calbuddy.co.il/\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: @StarterStoryBuild \n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - You don’t need an original idea\n1:04 - What’s your story?\n1:38 - What’s the app?\n2:15 - Founder background\n3:03 - Build process\n4:01 - Finding the app idea\n4:43 - More app ideas!\n5:32 - App differentiation \n6:40 - Growth and marketing\n8:00 - Influencer strategy\n9:05 - Partnership breakdown\n9:54 - Tech stack\n10:24 - Final advice\n11:05 - Pat and Gus reflections: you don’t need a new idea!\n\nThis video is an educational case study of this founder’s experience. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee any income or results. Every business is different and your results may vary.",
